🧠 AI Analysis Process
Step 1 – Resume Upload

The user uploads a resume in PDF format.

Step 2 – PDF Text Extraction

The workflow extracts the text from the resume.

Step 3 – Job Description Input

The user provides the job description.

Step 4 – AI Analysis

The AI Agent receives:

Resume Text
+
Job Description

The AI then analyzes both inputs.

Step 5 – Skill Comparison

The AI identifies:

Resume Skills
        ↓
Compare
        ↑
Job Requirements
Step 6 – Job Fit Evaluation

The AI calculates an estimated match percentage and assigns a fit category.

Step 7 – Resume Evaluation

The AI evaluates the quality and relevance of the resume.

Step 8 – Final Report

The user receives a structured report.

